{
  "conformance": "source.title-family-table",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "status": "ruled",
  "basis": [
    "a title_family table is refused at load unless its abbreviations name each token once and its families list is exactly what it can produce"
  ],
  "rule": "load(table) refuses in this order and accepts otherwise: abbreviation_not_a_token when a pair's token or replacement does not match ^[a-z0-9]+$ (a space, an uppercase letter, punctuation, or empty); duplicate_abbreviation_token when two abbreviations pairs have the same token; families_missing when a family the table can produce (every functions family_prefix joined by _ to every levels suffix, and other) is not in families; families_extra when families lists a value the table cannot produce. expect is accepted, or refused with the reason.",
